.key args/F
.bra {
.ket }
; Python needs a deep stack; the default 256 KB dies inside the parser.
Stack 16000000
; OpenSSL's compiled-in default CA path is a build path that does not exist on
; the target. Point it at the CA bundle shipped in this package.
SetEnv SSL_CERT_FILE /Python/ssl/ca-bundle.crt
; No -u here: on ABIv11 -u left the Shell's own output handle unbuffered
; after exit. Whether ABIv0 behaves the same was not checked; the launcher
; is kept identical to the x86_64 one.
Python:python {args}
